{"articleNo":"234558","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=234558&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] 2020 GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.02.13","hit":"6055","attachments":[{"name":"1. 2020 GKS-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86197"},{"name":"2. 2020 GKS-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86198"},{"name":"3. 2020 GKS-G Application FAQs (ENGLISH-KOREAN).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86199"},{"name":"4. 2020 GKS-G Application form.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86200"},{"name":"★2020 Available Fields of Study_KIT.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86201"},{"name":"2020 GKS-G 인원배정(안).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=234558&attachNo=86202"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">2020 <span style=\"color:blue\">GKS Admission Call</span>\nfor Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea</span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">We are pleased to inform you of 2020 GKS (Global\nKorea Scholarship) Guideline for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in\nKorea. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">As the one and only national engineering\nspecialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate candidates up to 35.\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;mso-font-kerning:\n0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">This might be a great opportunity for you to be\nable to study in Korea with a full government scholarship.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">Please see attached for\nfurther information and if there are any candidates interested in this program,\nplease send me <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><u><span style=\"color:red\">one original application document package </span></u></b></span><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">no\nlater than March 20th (Friday), 2020</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:\nbold\">. Your original application documents must be delivered to my office by\nthe deadline. <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3\nscale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80%\nfrom your university (Exception: A former or current KGSP scholar must hold the\ngrade of 90% or above)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">2. Applicants who submit applications to more than two designated\ninstitutions will be disqualified.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">3. Scholarship duration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of\nMaster'), Doctoral(1 yr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\ncolor:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">*In the case that\nscholar could not be able to complete one’s degree within scholarship duration,\nscholar should take care of one’s living expenses by oneself. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\ncolor:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">4. Applicants must be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1st, 2020(born\nafter Sep. 1, 1980).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">5. In case of submitting photocopied documents, applicants MUST have\nthe copies notarized or apostilled and then submit the notarized or apostilled\ncopies. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\ncolor:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send us\none original document by post only (no e-mail application will be accepted). We\ndon’t have online application for this GKS admission. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">For further information, please see attached, visit website\n(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nDejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\nmso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">) or contact GKS coordinator, Eugene Park. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Submission\nDeadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">: March 20<sup>th</sup>, 2020<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:red;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Submission\naddress</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">: <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">61\nDaehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea, <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"