bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Eugene\nPark<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">Office\nphone number) +82-54-478-7223<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">E-mail)\n</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:eugene@kumoh.ac.kr\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\nDejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">eugene@kumoh.ac.kr</span></b></a></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">, </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:eugenepark.kit@gmail.com\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\n13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">eugenepark.kit@gmail.com</span></b></a></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"> <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t